  rebut The prior verdict's blocker was a ground-truth execution log showing typecheck failing with TS1185 due to conflict markers in SettingsView.tsx. Those markers are gone (confirmed by repo-wide grep) and I independently re-ran both `npm run typecheck` and `cargo build` in this validation pass, both succeeding with zero errors, directly superseding the stale execution log the prior round relied on.
